  "25": {
   "text": "MONSTERS. — Besides keˊlet and vaˊɪrg̣ɪt, we hear of several kinds of",
   "edited": false
  },
  "26": {
   "text": "monsters. Among these are the killerwhales, which are said to be sea-",
   "edited": false
  },
  "27": {
   "text": "werwolves. They are called",
   "edited": false
  },
  "28": {
   "text": "ᵉɪᵋñɪpčiˊkɪt (literally, “long-nosed",
   "edited": true
  },
  "29": {
   "text": "birds”). No reason is given for",
   "edited": false
  },
  "30": {
